# Scoped ignore for the Instance Manager image build (BuildKit uses
# <Dockerfile>.dockerignore in preference to the root .dockerignore).
# The root .dockerignore excludes everything except *.go/go.mod; this build
# also needs the entrypoint script and the Go source trees.
**

!**/*.go
**/*_test.go
!go.mod
!go.sum
!build/instance-manager/entrypoint.sh
